### LOGIN USER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/user/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "user@gmail.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### POST NEW TEMPERATURE DATA (Dispara notificación 'crear')
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/temperatureData HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJfaWQiOiI2OTg3NWVjNGRhODMzNzJmNTFmMmM5ZGQiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzA0ODAxNjcsImV4cCI6MTc3MDQ4NzM2N30.blDv_xbzGRSv4OlVhHtMgbtmsrbjIpXYRdcNlq2cqGQ

{
    "value": 25.5,
    "sondaName": "Sonda-Madrid-01",
    "dateMedition": "2026-02-02T12:00:00Z",
    "hourMedition": "12:00"
}

### PUT TEMPERATURE DATA BY ID (Dispara notificación 'actualizar')
